RETAIL TRADE
Services of Retailers
Services to Wholesaler and Manufacturer
Helps in Distribution of Goods: Retailers relieve the
wholesalers and manufacturers from the burden of collecting
and supplying small orders to widely scattered customers.
Personal Selling: By undertaking personal selling efforts, the
retailer, relieves producers or wholesalers of this activity and
help them greatly in the proven of sale.
Enabling Large-Scale Production: The presence of Retailer
makes manufacturer and wholesalers free from the trouble of
making individual sales to consumer in small quantities. This
enables them to operate on large scale and fully concentrate
on their other activities.
